  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Qi Jue grotto-heaven he names himself to Luo clan’s three Gu Immortals, says he found the place twenty years before them, smiles coldly, and orders an attack to kill them all.",
      "chapters": [
        1996
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_qi_jue_grotto_heaven",
        "fac_luo_clan",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is about the size of a thumb, and there are translucent wings behind him.",
      "chapters": [
        1996
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "His face is tiny.",
      "chapters": [
        2173
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After the ambush, Luo clan sends an Immortal Gu House and the two sides fight at the heavenly wind qi wall. The other variant human Gu Immortals do not have high battle strength, but he is outstanding, and his side has an Immortal Gu House of its own. Luo clan is forced back to Southern Border.",
      "chapters": [
        1997
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-among-experts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "reg_southern_border"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He asks to see Wu Shuai, saying he has a huge fortune to give and wants to join the two heavens alliance. A reporting Gu Immortal says his reputation is long established among Gu Immortals of the two heavens, and that his strength is likely on par with the vice alliance leader, Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch. Wu Shuai has previous life information: Xiao He Jian was an expert among variant human rank eight Gu Immortals then, able to contest Heavenly Court’s members evenly. Wu Shuai judges him crafty, wanting to borrow the alliance to resist the Southern Alliance and obtain Qi Jue’s true inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        1997
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-among-experts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_shuai",
        "char_ice_crystal_immortal_monarch",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "fac_southern_alliance",
        "char_demon_immortal_qi_jue"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He sits at Wu Shuai’s right as the recently joined wood path great expert. After negotiation they set out for Qi Jue grotto-heaven. He explains that white qi currents form tunnels like the intestines of a giant, that Qi Jue’s true inheritance is hidden at the center, and that his tribe had been two obstacles away. He had kept secrets earlier so Wu Shuai would not snatch the inheritance alone.",
      "chapters": [
        1998
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "alliance-joining",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gu tribe’s leader is closer to Wu Shuai than Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch and Xiao He Jian, who are both vice alliance leaders.",
      "chapters": [
        2024
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "vice-leadership",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Xia clan headquarters he leads Green Forest Great Sage and Great Wisdom Immortal Mother against Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch’s group. Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch blames him for promoting Lady Cold Ash. He answers that they are both vice alliance leaders with equal positions, and that Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch invited Lady Cold Ash and took in Night Heavenly Wolf Lord. Green Forest Great Sage is also a miniman and stays close to him. With those two supporting him he can barely contend. When Wu Shuai and Fang Yuan arrive, he and Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch take the lead in kneeling.",
      "chapters": [
        2068
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "alliance-politics",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_xia_clan",
        "char_green_forest_great_sage",
        "char_great_wisdom_immortal_mother",
        "char_lady_cold_ash",
        "char_night_heavenly_wolf_lord",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu Shuai and Fang Yuan stay behind the scenes. He and Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch lead the variant human alliance to meet the Eastern Sea alliance army. Under Fang Yuan’s secret command he personally fights Shen Cong Sheng.",
      "chapters": [
        2069
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "alliance-politics",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "char_shen_cong_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan has subdued the variant human alliance. Two miniman Gu Immortals fly out of the palace: Xiao He Jian and Green Forest Great Sage. He has offered a rank eight Gu. He stands first on the contribution board, his contribution points in four digits. He has outstanding strength and is not weaker than a Heavenly Court expert, and he lowers his head in front of Fang Yuan.",
      "chapters": [
        2074
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "forced-immortal-gu-offering",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He and Green Forest Great Sage are rank eight miniman Gu Immortals of the variant human alliance. Their grotto-heavens are wood path grotto-heavens.",
      "chapters": [
        2081
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "grotto-heaven-materials",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In Crazed Demon Cave’s eighth layer he uses Spiraling Green Leaf Blade: countless flying leaves move like blades and spiral from all directions. Green Forest Great Sage and Black Locust appear beside him. The flying leaf blades turn into seeds that grow into vines.",
      "chapters": [
        2172
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "eighth-layer",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_crazed_demon_cave",
        "move_spiraling_green_leaf_blade",
        "char_black_locust"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Nie Kuang Feng demonizes, kills those two, then targets him. He cannot match it and has to retreat as he fights. After a few rounds of combat, his tiny face shows a grim expression, and his forehead is covered in sweat.",
      "chapters": [
        2173
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "eighth-layer",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_nie_kuang_feng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After recovering, he and Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch face Nie Kuang Feng together. He shoots green leaf blades, then uses Cut Grass: his palms slash down like blades, and two blades of leaves fall slowly, stabbing into ice cracks. They refuse surrender on their master’s orders. Nie Kuang Feng dies at their hands.",
      "chapters": [
        2178
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "eighth-layer",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_cut_grass"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Court is victorious in the eighth layer. The casualties on Fang Yuan’s side are severe. Experts like Xiao He Jian and Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch had perished.",
      "chapters": [
        2190
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
